Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:28.11,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(0,100)}人類…人類…人類…人類…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:30.66,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(100,100)\3c&H80B219&}可真是個麻煩的生物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:33.47,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(100,0)\3c&H80B219&}你說東他說西總唱反調
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:36.01,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}神明大人是否能告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.68,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}快開始一堂特別的課程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.02,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}對他人的事始終漠不關心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.96,OP/ED CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.2\be3\bord3.5\3c&H80B219&}{\fad(0,100)\3c&H80B219&}這對老實人不友好的世界
